{{!
    @template enrol_apply/profile_offer

    Offers to save the details an applicant just typed to their own profile.

    Every label and value is the plain spelling and is rendered through a double stash, so
    Mustache escapes each exactly once. Do not convert any of these to a triple stash: a
    custom profile field of the textarea datatype is PARAM_RAW and can carry a bare angle
    bracket.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading string - heading of the offer
    * intro string - one line explaining that nothing has been saved yet
    * beforelabel string - column heading for the current value
    * afterlabel string - column heading for the submitted value
    * fieldlabel string - column heading for the field name
    * changes array - list of label, before and after, one per field that would change
    * formurl string - url the confirmation posts to
    * sesskey string - session key
    * instanceid number - enrol instance the application belongs to
    * savelabel string - text of the save button

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Save these details for next time?",
        "intro": "Nothing has been saved to your profile yet.",
        "fieldlabel": "Detail",
        "beforelabel": "Your profile now",
        "afterlabel": "What you entered",
        "changes": [
            {"label": "City/town", "before": "Campinas", "after": "Belo Horizonte"},
            {"label": "Institution", "before": "", "after": "UFMG"}
        ],
        "formurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/profile.php",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "instanceid": 7,
        "savelabel": "Save to my profile"
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_apply-profile-offer">
    <h3>{{heading}}</h3>
    <p>{{intro}}</p>
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-sm">
            <caption class="visually-hidden">{{heading}}</caption>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">{{fieldlabel}}</th>
                    <th scope="col">{{beforelabel}}</th>
                    <th scope="col">{{afterlabel}}</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#changes}}
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="row">{{label}}</th>
                        <td>{{before}}</td>
                        <td>{{after}}</td>
                    </tr>
                {{/changes}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="instance" value="{{instanceid}}">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">{{savelabel}}</button>
    </form>
</div>
